  "regla": "Neuter lo + possessive pronoun means my/your/his thing, matters concerning me/you: Lo tuyo con Andrés = your thing with Andrés. Common uses: what someone is good at (Lo mío es la pintura; bailar no es lo mío), minding one's own business (Ella va a lo suyo), and what belongs to someone (Lo mío es tuyo).",
