              "texto": "**Ella va a lo suyo** = _she does her own thing_. **¡A lo nuestro!** = _back to work_."
            },
            {
              "forma": "belongings",
              "texto": "**Lo mío es tuyo** = _what's mine is yours_."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **lo mío** = _my thing_, in every sense of that English phrase."
